---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="About">
  <section class="container grid grid-2" style="align-items:center">
    <div>
      <img
        src="/moi.png"
        alt="John Awotwi"
        width="200"
        height="200"
        style="max-width:200px"
      />
    </div>

    <div>
      <h1>John Awotwi</h1>
      <p><strong>Technical Officer</strong></p>
      <p class="muted">
        Community Development · IT Specialist · Information Security
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="container">
    <h2>Self Introduction</h2>

    <p>
      I am passionate about people and technology, with extensive experience
      managing both technical systems and teams. I currently serve as a
      Technical Officer with the Communications Division of the
      Council for Scientific and Industrial Research – Institute for Scientific
      and Technological Information (CSIR-INSTI).
    </p>

    <p>
      In this role, I am responsible for transforming research outputs into
      practical software, tools, equipment, and communication systems that
      support national development.
    </p>

    <p>
      Community development is central to my professional identity. Over the
      past decade, I have grown and managed several technology communities in
      Ghana, most recently the Google Developer Group (GDG). I aspire to inspire.
    </p>

    <p>
      I enjoy exploring a wide range of technologies — from software development
      to hands-on hardware experimentation with platforms such as the
      Raspberry Pi.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="container">
    <h2>Affiliation</h2>
    <p>
      <a href="http://insti.csir.org.gh/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
        CSIR – Institute for Scientific and Technological Information (CSIR-INSTI)
      </a>
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="container">
    <h2>Connect</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>
        <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/johnawotwi/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
          LinkedIn
        </a>
      </li>
      <li>
        <a href="https://twitter.com/JeanHuit" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
          Twitter (X) - @JeanHuit
        </a>
      </li>
      <li>
        <a href="https://github.com/JeanHuit" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
          GitHub
        </a>
      </li>
    </ul>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
